<mxfile host="render_drawio.py">
  <diagram id="use-case" name="End the Tithe">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="BOUNDED-CONTEXT" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 8;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-160" y="-360" width="1400" height="1460" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="BOUNDED-CONTEXT-HEADER" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#D9D9D9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#333333;opacity=50;" value="Bounded Context: Tithe" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-160" y="-400" width="1400" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="BOUNDED-CONTEXT-DESCRIPTION" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;The Tithe itself: one run into the Maw for up to 8 candidates – players and NPC rivals – from the start room to the Champion. It lays out the depths from the Tithe's seed, holds the candidates and the monsters, resolves the blows, moves the candidates down the stairs, keeps their life and hunger, and ends a player's part of the Tithe when the gate is passed, someone else claims it, or the player falls or leaves. It also holds the help." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-150" y="-360" width="400" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="USE-CASE" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 8;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-120" y="-200" width="1320" height="1260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="USE-CASE-HEADER" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#D9D9D9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#333333;opacity=50;" value="Use Case: End the Tithe" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-120" y="-240" width="1320" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DESCRIPTION" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Description&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;For the player: the player's part of the Tithe ends when it has a Champion or the player falls or leaves, and the results show what the Tithe brought, so the player can see the progress and go again." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-110" y="-200" width="400" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
